msgid "Your site handed the message to your mail server successfully, so WordPress and this plugin did their part. It was lost, delayed or rejected afterwards - most often the receiving mailbox filed it as spam, or your host never delivered it from the outbound queue. Sending through an SMTP service, with SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this."
msgstr "Your site handed the message to your mail server successfully, so WordPress and this plugin did their part. It was lost, delayed or rejected afterwards - most often the receiving mailbox filed it as spam, or your host never delivered it from the outbound queue. Sending through an SMTP service, with SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this."

